Start the program.
Initialize the head pointer to NULL.
Display the menu: Add Coach at Beginning, Display Forward, Display Reverse, Delete First Coach, Search Coach, and Exit.
Accept the user's choice.
If Add Coach is selected, insert a new coach at the beginning of the doubly linked list.
If Display Forward is selected, display all coaches from first to last.
If Display Reverse is selected, traverse to the last coach and display coaches in reverse order.
If Delete First Coach is selected, remove the first node and update the head pointer.
If Search Coach is selected, search for the specified coach number.
If Exit is selected, release allocated memory and terminate the program.
Repeat the menu until Exit is selected.
Stop.
